{
    "title": "sQworble : Crossword Scramble",
    "description": "Get engaged with the most unique word puzzle game. Solve crossword scrambles and discover famous landmarks in jigsaw puzzles. Learn new words while you travel the world!\r\n\r\nMain features:\r\n- Fast Gameplay - Settle in for several levels or just find a few words when you\u2019ve got a minute to kill.\r\n- Large Library - Over 23,000 words and still growing!\r\n- Expand and personalize your library with themed WordPacks.\r\n- Word spellings localized for major English dialects.\r\n- Learn new words with the built in dictionary.\r\n- Choose Your Skill Level - Whether you want to keep it light and casual or give your brain the ultimate workout, you've got control.\r\n- Multiple Clues Per Word - If one clue doesn\u2019t do it for you, use the Switcharoo for a whole new view.\r\n- Exciting Hints - Use the Thought Light, Insight Glass, or the striking Enlightening Bolt to get you out of those sticky situations.\r\n- Mosaic - After every game, get up to 3 pieces of a puzzle and unscramble for additional coins. Use the pieces tray to keep your puzzle organized and the Snap Light to help solve those tricky puzzles. 750 images to discover!\r\n- Think a mosaic is too easy... too hard... amazingly fun? Give each mosaic a rating after you solve it.\r\n- Learn about the world with Mosaic descriptions highlighting the subject and/or location of the image.\r\n- Gallery - View your collection of completed Mosaics and replay your favorites in puzzles up to 100 pieces.\r\n- Challenging Levels - Earn extra coins for uncovering hidden tiles. \r\n- Landmarks - Discover 15 famous Landmarks in Mosaics. Build and upgrade Landmarks for fantastic daily rewards.\r\n- Daily Rewards - Come back every day to build your coins and item inventory.\r\n- Daily Puzzle - Big rewards and unlock 52 specialty avatars.\r\n- Daily Points Race - Compete with other players to reach the top of the Daily Leaderboard. Prizes for the Top 30!\r\n- Extremely customizable - make it YOUR game.\r\n- 8 default skins covering all moods and colors of the rainbow.\r\n- Get in the festive mood with different holiday skins throughout the year.\r\n- Switch it up with additional purchasable skins.\r\n- Integrated Game Rules.\r\n\r\nsQworble is free to play and uses in-app purchases to buy coins and items that assist in play.\r\n\r\nDownload this amazing and engaging crossword solver game to fill in your free time!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get engaged with the most unique word puzzle game. Solve crossword scrambles and discover famous landmarks in jigsaw puzzles. Learn new words while you travel the world!<br><br>Main features:<br>- Fast Gameplay - Settle in for several levels or just find a few words when you\u2019ve got a minute to kill.<br>- Large Library - Over 23,000 words and still growing!<br>- Expand and personalize your library with themed WordPacks.<br>- Word spellings localized for major English dialects.<br>- Learn new words with the built in dictionary.<br>- Choose Your Skill Level - Whether you want to keep it light and casual or give your brain the ultimate workout, you&#39;ve got control.<br>- Multiple Clues Per Word - If one clue doesn\u2019t do it for you, use the Switcharoo for a whole new view.<br>- Exciting Hints - Use the Thought Light, Insight Glass, or the striking Enlightening Bolt to get you out of those sticky situations.<br>- Mosaic - After every game, get up to 3 pieces of a puzzle and unscramble for additional coins. Use the pieces tray to keep your puzzle organized and the Snap Light to help solve those tricky puzzles. 750 images to discover!<br>- Think a mosaic is too easy... too hard... amazingly fun? Give each mosaic a rating after you solve it.<br>- Learn about the world with Mosaic descriptions highlighting the subject and/or location of the image.<br>- Gallery - View your collection of completed Mosaics and replay your favorites in puzzles up to 100 pieces.<br>- Challenging Levels - Earn extra coins for uncovering hidden tiles. <br>- Landmarks - Discover 15 famous Landmarks in Mosaics. Build and upgrade Landmarks for fantastic daily rewards.<br>- Daily Rewards - Come back every day to build your coins and item inventory.<br>- Daily Puzzle - Big rewards and unlock 52 specialty avatars.<br>- Daily Points Race - Compete with other players to reach the top of the Daily Leaderboard. Prizes for the Top 30!<br>- Extremely customizable - make it YOUR game.<br>- 8 default skins covering all moods and colors of the rainbow.<br>- Get in the festive mood with different holiday skins throughout the year.<br>- Switch it up with additional purchasable skins.<br>- Integrated Game Rules.<br><br>sQworble is free to play and uses in-app purchases to buy coins and items that assist in play.<br><br>Download this amazing and engaging crossword solver game to fill in your free time!",
